    "parent": "rack_B",
    "function": "Measures complex transmission S21 of a readout feedline against frequency. Each resonator appears as a notch whose depth and width give the loaded, internal and coupling quality factors; the notch moves by 2χ when the qubit is excited, which is how the dispersive shift is measured. Power sweeps reveal the punch-out from the dressed to the bare resonator frequency.",
